# Ops Checklist

Before working on any ticket or deploying, **read these**:

- `ops/trello.md` — Trello API credentials, board IDs, column workflow
- `DEPLOYMENT.md` (repo root) — the single source of truth for the deploy flow

## On Every Ticket

1. Read `ops/trello.md` to know the board, lists, and how to move cards via API
2. Read `DEPLOYMENT.md` to know the deploy flow and rules
3. After completing a ticket, move the Trello card to the appropriate column using the Trello API

## On Every Deploy

1. Follow `DEPLOYMENT.md` exactly — work on a branch, open a PR (review app),
   merge to `main` (staging auto-deploys), then promote to production
2. Pull latest before pushing (`git pull --rebase origin main`)
3. Update Trello board: move deployed cards to "Testing in Progress"
4. Never promote to production without explicit JP confirmation
